error BYN1065: `fails` must come before `uses`; the order is `where`, `expects`, `becomes`, `fails`,
`uses`

  4 │ i64 parse(string s) uses io fails ParseError {
    │                             ^^^^^ out of order
    │
  help: move `fails` before `uses`
    │ 4 │ i64 parse(string s) fails ParseError uses io {
    │   │                     ++++++++++++++++++++++++
